/T (An inventory management system will cost Rs.1crore. It will be depreciable on SLN basis for 5 years which Is its useful life. At the end of 5th year, it can be disposed for Rs.20 lakhs. This system will annually save Rs.30 lakhs before depreciation and tax. The tax rate is 30% and the system will require Rs. 10 lakhs initially as working capital. Assuming 10% cost of capital, calculate the net investment, net annual cash flows, terminal cashflow & NPV of this project.)
/E (An inventory management system will cost Rs.1crore. It will be depreciable on SLN basis for 5 years which Is its useful life. At the end of 5th year, it can be disposed for Rs.20 lakhs. This system will annually save Rs.30 lakhs before depreciation and tax. The tax rate is 30% and the system will require Rs. 10 lakhs initially as working capital. Assuming 10% cost of capital, calculate the net investment, net annual cash flows, terminal cashflow & NPV of this project.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
